{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51952","headline":"飞云山留题（飞云山王氏道院，去蒲村镇五里，昔有道人过之。留题云云。以逐句第三字合成「吕洞宾来」，主人觉而异之，已失道人所在矣。） · 吕岩","name":"飞云山留题（飞云山王氏道院，去蒲村镇五里，昔有道人过之。留题云云。以逐句第三字合成「吕洞宾来」，主人觉而异之，已失道人所在矣。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"携筇来此步飞云，钱满宾阶绿藓匀。\n江上同归共谁去，不堪回首不逢人。\n（《舆地纪胜》一五一《永康军·仙释》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}